{
  "sn35.62:0.1": "Linked Discourses 35.62 ",
  "sn35.62:0.2": "6. Ignorance ",
  "sn35.62:0.3": "The Depletion of All Fuel for Grasping (2nd) ",
  "sn35.62:1.1": "“Mendicants, I will teach you the principle for depleting all fuel for grasping. ",
  "sn35.62:1.2": "Listen … ",
  "sn35.62:1.3": "And what is the principle for depleting all fuel for grasping? ",
  "sn35.62:2.1": "What do you think, mendicants? ",
  "sn35.62:2.2": "Is the eye permanent or impermanent?” ",
  "sn35.62:3.1": "“Impermanent, sir.” ",
  "sn35.62:4.1": "“But if it’s impermanent, is it suffering or happiness?” ",
  "sn35.62:5.1": "“Suffering, sir.” ",
  "sn35.62:6.1": "“But if it’s impermanent, suffering, and perishable, is it fit to be regarded thus: ",
  "sn35.62:6.2": "‘This is mine, I am this, this is my self’?” ",
  "sn35.62:7.1": "“No, sir.” ",
  "sn35.62:8.1": "“Sights … ",
  "sn35.62:8.2": "eye consciousness … ",
  "sn35.62:9.1": "",
  "sn35.62:10.1": "eye contact … ",
  "sn35.62:11.1": "",
  "sn35.62:12.1": "The pleasant, painful, or neutral feeling that arises dependent on eye contact: is that permanent or impermanent?” ",
  "sn35.62:13.1": "“Impermanent, sir.” … ",
  "sn35.62:14.1": "“Ear … ",
  "sn35.62:14.2": "nose … ",
  "sn35.62:14.3": "tongue … ",
  "sn35.62:14.4": "body … ",
  "sn35.62:14.5": "mind … ",
  "sn35.62:14.6": "ideas … ",
  "sn35.62:14.7": "mind consciousness … ",
  "sn35.62:14.8": "mind contact … ",
  "sn35.62:14.9": "The pleasant, painful, or